    {
      "id": "25e42341d91fca79c439b26c9f0ac943ccc970fa",
      "short_id": "25e42341",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T19:08:55.000+05:30",
      "parent_ids": [
        "857d9b98e9d70c0f0666bea18c3b2b060e5bd93b"
      ],
      "title": "openflow_v4: validate hello element length to prevent exception",
      "message": "openflow_v4: validate hello element length to prevent exception\n\nIn OpenFlow 1.3 hello elements, elem_length includes the 4-byte header. An elem_length < 4 causes offset subtraction underflow (elem_length - 4) when reading the version bitmap and an exception or loop.\n\nRegister and report ei_openflow_v4_hello_element_length_bad when elem_length < 4, and safely terminate hello element dissection.\n",
      "author_name": "Ayush Meel",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-10T19:08:55.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "Ayush Meel",
      "committer_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
